  "answer": "This has been reported before: the Quick Access / system tray menu in PowerToys ignores the language chosen in PowerToys settings and uses the Windows display language instead (here Italian rather than English). The past tickets (#46032 for the Quick Access menu, #42677 for the 'Show system tray icon' text, #41321 for the tray right-click menu) describe the same symptom, but the archived tickets don't include a fix or workaround. The only way to get the tray/Quick Access text in the desired language for now is to set the Windows display language to match it. Please add your report and version (0.100.2) to the existing ticket, such as #46032, and watch it for a fix."
